  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). A Streamlit dashboard for following reservoir water area (OPERA DSWx-S1 radar) and snow and glacier area (OPERA DSWx-HLS optical) in the Enguri and Zhinvali dam catchments, through headline KPI cards, a catchment map, time-series charts and a date-stepped scene browser with the raw per-date tables. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
